          ],
          "description": "The music bed, with its provenance on record. Required in narrated mode: a narrated deliverable with no bed is an unfinished edit, and asking the client afterwards is the edit's own job arriving late. Use `omitMusicReason` to record a deliberate silence instead.",
          "properties": {
            "path": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "source": {
              "type": "string",
